@startuml XemYeuCauTraPhong_SequenceDiagram
title Sequence Diagram - UC23: Xem yêu cầu trả phòng

' --- STYLE CONFIGURATION ---
skinparam {
    BackgroundColor White
    ArrowColor #2D3E50
    DefaultFontName "Arial"
    DefaultFontSize 24
    ParticipantPadding 20
    BoxPadding 10
}

actor "Khách hàng" as Actor
boundary "ScreenCheckoutRequestList" as ListScreen <<boundary>>
boundary "ScreenCheckoutRequestDetail" as DetailScreen <<boundary>>
control "CheckoutRequest" as BUS_Request <<control>>
database "CheckoutRequestDB" as DB_Request <<database>>
control "Contract" as BUS_Contract <<control>>
database "ContractDB" as DB_Contract <<database>>
control "RefundCalculator" as BUS_Calc <<control>>
database "RefundCalculationDB" as DB_Calc <<database>>

autonumber

Actor -> ListScreen: yêu cầu xem danh sách trả phòng
activate ListScreen
ListScreen -> BUS_Request: getListByCustomer(customerID)
activate BUS_Request
BUS_Request -> DB_Request: fetchByCustomer(customerID)
activate DB_Request
DB_Request --> BUS_Request: DataTable
deactivate DB_Request
BUS_Request --> ListScreen: List<CheckoutRequest>
deactivate BUS_Request
ListScreen --> Actor: hiển thị danh sách yêu cầu
deactivate ListScreen

Actor -> ListScreen: nhấp chọn xem chi tiết
activate ListScreen
ListScreen -> DetailScreen: show(requestID)
activate DetailScreen

DetailScreen -> BUS_Request: getById(requestID)
activate BUS_Request
BUS_Request -> DB_Request: fetchById(requestID)
activate DB_Request
DB_Request --> BUS_Request: DataRow
deactivate DB_Request
BUS_Request --> DetailScreen: CheckoutRequest object
deactivate BUS_Request

DetailScreen -> BUS_Contract: getById(contractId)
activate BUS_Contract
BUS_Contract -> DB_Contract: fetchById(contractId)
activate DB_Contract
DB_Contract --> BUS_Contract: DataRow
deactivate DB_Contract
BUS_Contract --> DetailScreen: Contract object
deactivate BUS_Contract

alt trạng thái là "Đã duyệt" hoặc "Thanh lý"
    DetailScreen -> BUS_Calc: getByRequestId(requestID)
    activate BUS_Calc
    BUS_Calc -> DB_Calc: fetchByRequestId(requestID)
    activate DB_Calc
    DB_Calc --> BUS_Calc: DataRow
    deactivate DB_Calc
    BUS_Calc --> DetailScreen: RefundCalculator object
    deactivate BUS_Calc
end

DetailScreen --> Actor: hiển thị thông tin chi tiết
deactivate DetailScreen
deactivate ListScreen

@enduml